<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timothy</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Krista Isuaa nunna awm tiamna thu hril kawnga Pathian duh zâwnga Krista Isua tirhkoh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka fa duh tak Timothea hnênah: Pathian kan Pa leh Krista Isua kan Lalpa hnên ata khawngaihna te, zahngaihna te, remna te lo awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lâwmin ka khah theih nân hmuh che ka duh êm êm a, i mittui hre rengin a chhûn a zânin bâng lovin ka ṭawngṭainaahte chuan ka hriatpui ṭhin che avângin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka hril a ni, min thlahtute chena chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang tak neia a rawng ka bâwl ṭhina hnênah chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />rinna tak tak nangmaha awm chu ka hre reng si a, chu rinna chu a tîrin i pi Loisi-ah chuan a awm a, i nu Euniki-ah chuan a awm bawk a, nangmahah pawh a awm tih dik takin ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka kut nghah avânga Pathian thilpêk nangmaha awm kha chhêm alh tûrin ka hriatpui che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathianin hlauhna thlarau min pe lo va, thiltihtheihna leh hmangaihna leh rilru fel tak neihna thlarau min pe zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan Lalpa thu hriattîrna chu zahpui suh la, kei, ama mi tâng pawh hi mi zahpui hek suh ang che. Chanchin Ṭha avânga hrehawm hi Pathian thiltihtheihna angzia zelin mi tuarpui zâwk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan kan thiltih angte ni lovin, ama ruat leh khawngaihna ang zâwkin min chhandam a, kohna thianghlimin min ko bawk a; chu khawngaihna chu leilung pian hmain Krista Isuaah chuan min pêk a ni tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nimahsela, min chhandamtu Krista Isua inlârna avâng hian tûnah tihlanin a awm ta. Ani chuan thihna chu a tiboralin, Chanchin Ṭhain nunna leh boral theih lohna a tilang ta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chumi Chanchin Ṭha thu chu hriattîr tûrin, tlângaupuituah leh tirhkohvah leh zirtîrtuah ruat ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni hêng thil pawh hi ka tuar ni; nimahsela, ka zak lo ve; ka rina chu ka hria, a hnêna ka kawltîr chu, chumi ni atân chuan a vawng ṭha thei tih dik takin ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Krista Isuaa awm rinna leh hmangaihna neiin, thu dik dân ka kâa i hriatte kha nei tlat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ṭha i hnêna kawltîra awm kha, kan chhûnga Thlarau Thianghlim awm hian vawng ṭha rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia rama awm zawng zawngten mi hawisan tih kha i hria a; an zîngah chuan Phugella leh Hermogena an tel a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Onesiphora chhûngte hnênah zahngaihna pe rawh se, ani chuan mi tiharh fo va, ka khaidiat bun pawh mi zahpui si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rom khuaa a lo kal lai khân ngun takin mi zawng chhuak ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Chumi nîah chuan Lalpa hnênah zahngaihna hmu tûrin Lalpa chuan ani chu ruat rawh se.) Ephesi khuaa rawng a bâwl nasatzia kha i hre hle bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, nang ka fa, Krista Isuaa khawngaihna awmah hian thiltihtheihna neiin awm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hretu tam takte zînga ka kâa thu i hriatte kha, chûng chu mi rinawm, mi dangte zirtîr chhâwng thei tur angte hnênah chuan kawltîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista Isua sipai ṭha tak angin hrehawm mi tuarpui rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sipaia awm tura thlangtu chu a tihlâwm theih nân sipai tu mah, indo laiin tûn dam chhûng khawsaknate hian a intihnawk ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, intihsiaknaahte pawh chuan miin bei mah sela, dân angin a beih loh chuan khumtîrin a awm ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lo neitu thawk rim chu a rah chang hmasatu a ni tur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thusawi hi ngaihtuah rawh; Lalpa chuan kawng engkimah hriat theihna a pe dâwn si chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isua Krista, Davida thlaha mi, ka Chanchin Ṭha sawi anga mitthi zîng ata tho leha kha hre reng rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chu Chanchin Ṭha avâng chuan thil tisualtu angin, phuar khawp hialin hrehawmte ka tuar ṭhîn a ni; nimahsela, Pathian thu chu phuarin a awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Krista Isuaa awm chhandamna chu chatuana ropuina nên an hmuh ve theihna tûrin, Thlante avâng chuan engkim ka tuar ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He thu hi a rinawm a ni: “A thihnaah kan thih tawh si chuan, A nunnaah kan nung bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan tuar chuan, A rorêlnaah ro kan rêl ang; Amah kan phatsan chuan, Ani pawhin min phatsan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keini rinawm lovin awm mah ila, Ani chu rinawmin a awm reng a ni; Amah leh amah a inphat thei si lo va,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng thu chu hriatpui la, thu mai mai chunga an inhnial loh nân Lalpa mit hmuhah ṭhahnemngai takin hriattîr rawh, chu chu engah mah a ṭangkai lo va, a ngaithlatute tân boralna a ni zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnathawktu, thutak thu fel taka hmang chu zak tûr a ni lo angin, Pathian ngaiha ṭhaa inentîr tûrin ṭhahnem ngai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Pathian zah lo lam thu sawi mai mai chu hawisan ṭhîn ang che; chutiang mite chu Pathian ngaihsak lohna lamah an nasa lehzual ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an thu pawh chuan pân chhe ei angin a ei zêl ang; an zîngah chuan Humenaia leh Phileta an tel a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chûng mite chuan, “Thawhlehna chu tûnah pawh a ni tawh daih,” tiin, thutak kawng chu an kal kawisan a, mi ṭhenkhatte rinna an tibo ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian lungphûm nghet chu a la ding reng a, he chhinchhiahna hi a nei a: “Lalpa chuan ama tâte chu a hria,” tih leh, “Lalpa hming lam apiang chuan sual kalsan rawh se,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, in ropuiah hian bungbêl, rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam chauh a awm lo va, thing leh belleia siamte pawh a awm ṭhîn a; ṭhenkhat ngaihhlut tûr a awm a, ṭhenkhat chu ngaihhlut loh tûr a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, chûng thil laka mi a inthiarfihlîm chuan bungbêl thianghlim, Lalpa hman tlâk, hnathawh ṭha tinrênga inpeih sa, ngaihhlut tûr mi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, tleirâwl châknate chu tlânsan la, thinlung thianghlima Lalpa lam apiangte zîngah chuan felna te, rinna te, hmangaihna te, remna te ûm ve rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, indonate a hring ṭhîn tih hriain, inhnialna âtthlâk leh fing lovahte chuan tel duh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa bâwih chuan do tûr a ni si lo va, mi zawng zawng chungah zaidamin, zirtîr thiamin, sual chungah dawhtheiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />do tûra insiamte chu thuhnuairawlh takin a zirtîr zâwk tûr a ni; chutichuan, Pathianin thutak chu an hriat famkim nân a simtîr hlauhvin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian duh zâwng ti atân Lalpa bâwihin a manin, Diabola thang ata an chhuak thei mahna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, hei hi hre rawh, ni hnuhnûngahte chuan hun khirh takte a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi, mahni inhmangaihtu te, tangka ngainatu te, intivei te, chapo te, Pathian sawichhetu te, nu leh pa thu âwih lo te, lâwm nachâng hre lo te, thianghlim lo te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hmangaihna pianpui nei lo te, huaikawm bâwl te, hêktu te, insûm thei lo te, mi kawlhsen te, ṭha duh hauh lo te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />vervêk te, thuhnu dâwn lo te, inngaihlu te, Pathian hmangaih aia mahni lâwmna mai hmangaih zâwktu te an ni dâwn si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak anna an nei ang a; nimahsela, a thiltihtheihna chu an âwih lo vang; chûng ang chu hawisan rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng zînga mite chu inahte lûta, sual rit phur hmeichhe â deuhte sala man ṭhîntute kha an ni si; chutiang hmeichhiate chu châkna tinrênga hruai bo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />zir fo sia thutak hre phâk ngai lote an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Jannia leh Jambrian Mosia an dodal ang khân, chûng mite pawh chuan thutak hi an dodâl ṭhîn; rilru chhe tawh, rinna kawngah chuan Pathian duh loh zâwng mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng aliam chu an ti lo vang, an âtzia mi zawng zawng hnênah a lo lang dâwn si a, Jannia leh Jambria âtzia a lo lang ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan ka zirtîrna te, ka awm dân te, ka thil tum te, ka rinna te, ka dawhtheihna te, ka hmangaihna te, ka chhelna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mi min tihduhdahna te, ka tuarna te i hre hle mai; Antiokei khuaah te, Ikonion khuaah te, Lustra khuaah te ka chunga thil thleng leh tihduhdah ka tuarnate kha; chûng zawng zawngah chuan Lalpa chuan mi chhandam ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, tu pawh Krista Isuaa Pathian ngaihsaka awm tum apiang chuan tihduhdahnate an tuar bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi sual leh tihdertute erawh chu mi bum leh buma awmin an sual zual deuh deuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang zawng, tu hnêna zir nge i nih leh, Krista Isuaa rinna awm avâng chuan, chhandamna hmu khawpa tifing thei che Lehkha Thianghlimte chu i naupan têt ata hre tawh i ni tih inhriain, i thil zir leh i thil hriat chianahte chuan awm reng rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian Lehkha Thu zawng zawng hi Pathian thâwk khuma pêk a ni a, zirtîr kawngah te, thiam loh chantîr kawngah te, zilh kawngah te, felna zirtîr kawngah te a sâwt bawk a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian mi chu hna ṭha tinrêng thawk tûra kim taka inthuamin a famkim theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian mit hmuh leh, mi nung leh mitthi ngaihtuahtu tûr Krista Isua mit hmuhah chuan, a inlârna leh a ram chhâlin, ṭhahnemngai takin ka hriattîr a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu chu hril rawh; a hunah te, a hun lovah te pawh bei zêl rawh; dawh thei taka zirtîr chungin an thiam loh hriattîr la, zilh la, fuih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zirtîrna dik an ngaih peih loh hun a la thleng dâwn si; an bengte a zat avângin, anmahni duh zâwng angin zirtîrtute an hnênah an khâwm zâwk ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an bengte chu thutak lamah an chhu ngawng ang a, thawnthu lam panin an pêng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang erawh chu engkimah fîmkhur la, hrehawm tuar la, Chanchin Ṭha hriltu lam hna thawk la, i rawngbâwlna kha hlen rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei zawng tûnah pawh hlanin ka awm mêk a ni si a, ka chhuah hun a thleng tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Intihsiakna ṭha chu ka bei zo tawh a, ka tlânsiakna kawng ka hlen tawh a, rinna chu ka vawng reng tawh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tûnah chuan felna lallukhum chu ka tân dahin a awm tawh a, chu chu Lalpa, ngaihtuahtu fel tak chuan chumi nîah chuan mi pe ang; ka hnênah chauh ni lovin, a inlârna ngai apiangte hnênah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rang takin ka hnênah lo kal hrâm rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dema chuan tûnlai khawvêl hi a ngainat avângin mi kalsan a, Thessalonika khuaah a kal ta si a; Kreska chu Galatia ramah a kal ta a, Tita chu Dalmatia ramah a kal ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luka chauh ka hnênah a awm ta a. Marka kha sâwm la, han hruai ve rawh, ani chu rawngbâwl lamah ka tân a ṭangkai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukika zawng Ephesi khuaah ka tîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I lo kal hunah Troas khuaah Karpa hnêna kawrfual ka hnutchhiah kha, lehkhabute nên khân rawn keng la, savun lehkha mawlh kha rawn keng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aleksandra, dâr chhûn thiam kha, ka chungah a sual êm êm ṭhîn a ni; Lalpa chuan a thiltih ang zêlin a thungrûl ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a lakah khân nang pawh fîmkhur rawh, kan thu a dodâl nasa êm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thiamna thu ka sawi hmasak ṭum chuan tu mah rêngin mi ṭanpui lo va, mi thlahthlam ta vek zâwk a ni; a mawh chu phurin awm hlawm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha chu keimah avânga hrilh kimin a awm theih nân leh, Jentail-te zawng zawng chuan an hriat theih nân Lalpa chuan mi ṭan a, mi tichak ta zâwk a ni; tin, sakeibaknei kâa mi kha chhan chhuahin ka lo awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan sualna zawng zawng lakah mi chhan chhuak ang a, a vânramah chuan him takin mi thlen ang; amah chu chatuana ropuiin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priskilli leh Akuila, Onesiphora chhûngte nên khan chibai mi bûksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erasta chu Korinth khuaah chuan a awm ta reng a, Trophima erawh chu Mileti khuaah dam lovin ka kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlasik hmain lo kal hrâm hrâm ang che. Eubula te, Pudea te, Lina te, Klaudi te, unau zawng zawngte nên chibai an bûk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chu i thlarau hnênah awm rawh se. Khawngaihna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
